<title>USA: Life USA Holding Inc first quarter net rises.</title>
<headline>Life USA Holding Inc first quarter net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31</p>
<p>						 1997	  1996</p>
<p>  TOTAL REVENUES			  79,352	73,554</p>
<p>  TOTAL EXPENSES			  71,272	66,232</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	    8,080	 7,322</p>
<p>  NET INCOME				 5,145	 4,621</p>
<p>  EARNINGS PER SHARE			 .22	   .21</p>
<p>Number of shares used in earnings</p>
<p>   per share calculation	  24,119,701  22,904,123</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>NOTE: Consolidated net operating income for Q1 1997 was $4.7 million or $0.21 a share versus $4.4 million or $0.20 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787)) Monday, 14 April 1997 20:04:47 ENDS  nN14176665</p>
